{
  "$description": "101 Codecrafts design tokens. Source of truth for web (css/tokens.css, generated by tools/tokens.py) and future Android/iOS/Windows/macOS apps. Colours sampled from the two mockups. Round 13: DESIGN.md (repo root) is the human/agent-readable spec of these tokens; css/ds.css applies the r13 layout layer (live site only).",
